{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_yak_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_yak_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "一天",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_yak_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d40178bf6e224038e4d3d4d26f54b57d85895599b216267ddb981899ec1d4b23",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "角峰"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "text": "走過看一看，瞧一瞧啊，新鮮的蔬菜與水果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "text": "哎，老爺子，那不是耶克家的小子嗎？好久都不見他來這集市了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "text": "說什麼呢，那孩子現在是領主家的護衛，怎麼可能有時間來逛市場啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "阿伯，好久不見了，身體怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "text": "哎呀呀，還真的是你啊，馬特洪。嘿，你這小子怎麼今天有空來我們這裡啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "最近幾天空下來了，想著也該為老爺做頓晚飯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "text": "就是就是，你那個廚藝可不能荒廢了。來來，這條肉排你拿去，記得老爺小時候最愛吃，你每次來都是提一兜子才走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "謝謝您的好意了，不過還是先秤五斤里脊肉吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "text": "哎，那個時候二小姐也還是小姑娘，你出來買菜她總跟在你屁股後面，小手就拽著你的衣角。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈，恩希亞小姐那時候還小，好奇心重，在家裡待不住，就帶出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "text": "喏，里脊切好了，給你。欸，是老爺他口味變了，不愛吃小排了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "是啊，老爺他......長大了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "text": "馬特洪啊，大小姐，不對不對，看我這糊塗腦袋，聖女大人近來好不好？我們......都惦念著她呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "聖女大人她......身體安康，一切都還好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "text": "耶拉岡德庇佑著聖女大人，定會諸事順遂的，老爺子寬心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "text": "也是多虧了聖女大人在危急時刻出現穩定了局面，我們這日子才能繼續往下過啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "聖女大人冰雪聰明，危機當前尚能沉著應對，更不會被其他事難倒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "text": "好好好，聖女大人與老爺兄妹齊心，我們日後只會更好的，哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "（若真如此便好了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "text": "哎呀，一轉眼你們都這麼大了，這日子啊，過得可真快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "text": "可不是，你們長大了，大娘我也老了，還是年輕的時候好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "......您現在還和從前一樣容光煥發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈，數你嘴甜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "text": "怎麼了，想什麼呢，皺著個眉頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "大娘......我想了想，還是給我秤些小排吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "text": "好，等著啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "text": "給你，這些夠嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "夠了，謝謝您。應該是這麼多錢吧，我就放在桌子上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "text": "嗨，還是你們年輕人算得快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "好了，大娘，阿伯，我先回去了，這時候廚房裡該開始準備晚餐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "text": "好好好，快去吧，別耽誤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "text": "有空常來啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "（唔......是角峰叔，他怎麼站在這裡一動不動的？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "角峰叔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "是很難了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "角峰叔，你端著盤子站在走道裡嘀嘀咕咕什麼呢？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "恩希亞小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "不是說今天要找極光他們在外面吃晚飯嗎，還沒有出發？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "時間還早呢，不著急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "哇，晚餐這麼豐盛，今天家裡有客人來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "沒有，只是老爺今天難得回家用晚餐，我也正好有空，主動要求下廚做兩道菜而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "這可不止兩道菜啊。我看看......還有我最愛吃的燴肉欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "怎麼辦，不想出去吃了，感覺在家裡和老哥一起吃頓晚飯也不錯啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "哈哈，那恩希亞小姐就留在家裡吃吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "二小姐還想吃什麼？我再去燒幾道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "不了不了，角峰叔你太誇張了！這些菜已經足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "好好，恩希亞小姐您先稍作等待，廚房裡還有一道湯在燉著，我一會兒端過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "那我先去洗手啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "（這、二小姐也在的話......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "（一會兒......怎麼好和老爺開口呢？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "恩希亞小姐，湯為您端上來了，要先——呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "角峰大哥，晚上好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "魏斯，怎麼只有你來了，老爺沒回來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "訊使哥剛剛告訴我，老哥有急事，估計不能回來吃晚飯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "二小姐別太難過，事情來得突然，老爺也是不得已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "這樣嗎......要不，我們再等等老爺，說不定晚些時候還會回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "角峰大哥......借一步說話可以嗎?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "是有什麼不能當著恩希亞小姐的面說嗎？非得要我避開來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "角峰大哥，我想著，要不你還是別等了......你也知道，老爺忙起來就什麼都顧不上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "嗯，魏斯，我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "角峰大哥！勸你一句，別等了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "或許老爺晚歸......就已經是給了大哥你答覆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "魏斯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "何況這答案，心細如大哥你，應該早已......明瞭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "好了好了，我知道了。對了，前幾天我燻了些肉乾，一會兒去廚房給你包些，你帶著當零嘴吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "大哥你......果然還是不願接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "不過還是謝謝你的好意了，大哥。但是我最近受了點傷，醫生囑咐我要忌口，所以只好心領了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "魏斯你受傷了？！在哪裡？醫生怎麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "一點小傷而已，不是什麼大事，不必再讓角峰大哥擔心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "怎麼不和我說呢？現在你有事總瞞著我，才是最讓我擔心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "哈哈，從小到大，每次受傷都讓大哥你操心。現在大了，再讓你操心，多難為情啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "是啊......你現在也大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "......角峰大哥，我還有事......就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "等下，魏斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "（在口袋中摸索）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "大哥，你在找什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "給你，拿著吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "這是......雪酥糖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "早上路過糖鋪的時候買的，你小時候每次訓練受傷都會告訴我，纏著我要些雪酥糖吃。我還害怕你吃壞牙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "結果你這傢伙現在不跟我要了，大哥我竟然有點不習慣，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "角峰大哥......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "（拆開糖紙）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "大哥......你之後還有空嗎？等我傷好了......就一起去酒館喝一杯吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "好啊，看你時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訊使",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "text": "那大哥，我先走了，回頭見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "角峰叔，訊使哥怎麼說？老哥今晚還回來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "恩希亞小姐，您先吃吧，老爺估計很晚才能回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "呼，果然是這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "那角峰叔你也坐下來一起吃吧，我一個人吃飯不香的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "......嗯，好，恩希亞小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "先喝碗肉湯吧，大骨頭吊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "嘶溜——好濃郁的味道啊，角峰叔，你的手藝真是沒得說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "哈哈，二小姐可以再嘗嘗這塊炭烤小排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "啊嗚啊嗚，好吃好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "二小姐慢點吃，別噎著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "啊嗚，角峰叔你也快吃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "哎，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "（二小姐今天吃得很香啊，看她前幾天胃口不好的樣子，還以為......看來是我多慮了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "角峰叔，那個蹄筋燉得好軟嫩，再給我來一個吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "好，給您端過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "我再喝碗湯，裡面的肉丸很入味，超好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "二小姐......您這，還能吃下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "我還沒吃飽呢，角峰叔，再來一碗馬鈴薯泥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "二小姐還沒吃飽？這已經是第三碗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "（二小姐她已經吃了遠超自己食量的食物......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "（咀嚼）你做的菜......太美味了嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "（努力吞咽）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "（捂嘴）不好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "嗝呃——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "恩希亞小姐......吃不下的話，就算了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "我、我......好像是有點飽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "可是、可是還剩了好多啊，角峰叔費心思做了這麼多，剩下的話，實在太對不起你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "可是如果恩希亞小姐因此撐壞了肚子，我也會不好受啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "角峰叔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "只要恩希亞小姐您能帶著愉悅的笑容享受美食，我就能滿足了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "可是，可是，要是老哥也在，就能吃完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "二小姐是因為沒有等到老爺，所以感到有些沮喪嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "是啊，好久都沒和老哥一起面對面吃晚飯了。早上他匆匆就走了，晚上又很晚才到家，一天到晚和他連面都見不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "你說，我偷跑去見姐姐，打亂了老哥的安排，應該是真的惹他動怒了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "二小姐......並沒有做錯什麼，老爺他......不會怪罪您的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "角峰叔，要是還能有那麼一天就好了，大家說說笑笑，再聚在飯桌旁享用你的拿手菜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "恩希亞小姐......請不要擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "我一直都在的，只要您想吃，我隨時為您準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "無論......將來發生了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "嗚......角峰叔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "天色不早了，恩希亞小姐早些休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "崖心",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "嗯，角峰叔你也早點休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "（收拾桌子上的碗碟）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "嘶——該如何是好啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺，您回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "角峰你......一直等到這麼晚嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "不是讓訊使回來說過，今天有急事，我不回來用晚餐了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "想著老爺您總是忙得顧不上吃飯，可能餓著肚子就回來了，所以我就決定再等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "也好，家裡還有什麼吃的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺您想吃什麼，我現做幾道您愛吃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "不必了，晚飯熱一熱端上來就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "這......不好吧。畢竟是些殘羹剩飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "怎麼，恩希亞今天沒有出去吃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "二小姐聽說老爺今晚會回來，特意留下來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "知道了，明天我會早些回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "屬下明白了，那今晚您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "反正是恩希亞吃過的，不妨事，端上來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "......是，老爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺，今晚備下的晚餐就是這些了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "做了很多，角峰你費心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "是屬下應該的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "你的手怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "是剛剛一時不慎，打碎了盤子，割到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "去擦些藥吧，好得快些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "是，老爺，一會兒就去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "這是......炭烤小排？好久沒吃過這道菜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺要嘗嘗嗎？還是按著您從前喜歡的口味做的，一點兒也沒變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "言畢，角峰感受到銀灰的視線在自己身上掃了個來回，他突然心慌，好像那些自己藏在腹中的話，被銀灰如炬的目光徹底洞察清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "不必了，給我盛一碗肉湯吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "......是，稍等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "（輕抿一口）很鮮，你的手藝一直很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺吃著舒心就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "你還做了燴獸肉，恩希亞一直最愛吃這個，難怪留得不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "恩希亞小姐她......今天下午等了您很久，心裡一直很忐忑，害怕老爺您會因為當時的事責怪她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "你對恩希亞的事一向很上心。也是，她年紀最小，你難免操心她多些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "吃過再說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "餐廳內，銀灰沒再說話，只有輕微的咀嚼聲在空氣中反覆響起。角峰的喉頭幾次滾動，也沒能吐出，哪怕隻言片語。\n終於，銀灰放下手中的餐具，拿起餐巾拭了拭嘴角。雖然心裡打著鼓，角峰還是抬起了頭，準備看向銀灰的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "你這湯煲了多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "大差不差，有一天了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "一天，也就你能耐得住性子等一天了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺過獎了，這些事情都急不來的，人急了，湯就不好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "那湯在爐火上滾著，溢出來怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "心細些煨湯，不會溢出來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "不錯，可一直小心翼翼煨著，湯也不會好。時候到了還是要當機立斷把火滅掉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺說的不錯，確實是這個道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "所以，角峰——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "你想好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺，屬下......已經決定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "那麼，角峰，以後......便不必再聽命於我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "......老爺也是希望我全職衛護在二小姐的身邊嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "確實，比起我，現在恩希亞更需要你的衛護。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "若老爺有需要，屬下還是會隨時為您效力的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "不，不要。你不僅要全職衛護恩希亞的安全，更要全心全意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺的指令，屬下必然遵守。可我還是不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺......是何時做出這樣的決定的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "角峰，我們是從何時相識的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "從您還在襁褓中時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "那麼久了啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "耶克家族世代為領主效力，這是我身為領主家的護衛與生俱來的使命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "護衛......角峰，恩雅與恩希亞都視你為家人，你還堅持如此自稱嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺，屬下從不敢僭越。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "你不必惶恐。我不是問你，只是說句實話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "從維多利亞回來後，事情樁樁件件壓下來，角峰，你確實有些難處，能看出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "勞煩老爺您掛心了，只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "只是老爺與恩雅、恩希亞小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "好了，恩雅與恩希亞，有你照顧著，我也能安心許多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺這些年受苦了，是屬下不能及時替您分憂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "......角峰，我的兩個妹妹，你無論如何都要保護她們周全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "屬下定然不惜性命也會堅守在恩雅與恩希亞小姐身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "我會記著這話的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "好了，你先下去吧，我要休息了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "馬特洪——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "您還有什麼吩咐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀灰",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "text": "沒有，只是......謝謝這些年......你在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "老爺......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
      "text": "早些休息吧，不要太勞累......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
